{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butterfly X Demo is consist of 16 levels and all the options of main game are available in it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free Butterfly X game does not have any in-game purghases to progress tjrough the game\u00a0 and\u00a0 featuring  characters from all versions of the Butterfly series of puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can choose any level to pass through. But it will be great if you pass them all, helping the caterpillar to fulfill its mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As usual, the caterpillar can't jump on its own. It can fly from place to place like a butterfly, bouncing off various game objects in its path. It also moves around the level on pipes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you will enjoy it and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Collect all the flowers to advance to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kill bees and bounce off objects to advance to the end of the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use pipes along the way to overcome obstacles in the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Moving objects help to pass the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are several paths, find the right one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Beware of the blue bird, it pecks to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - The levels are very different,\u00a0be alert.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048700?t=1758555611","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048700?t=1758555611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048700/d7b416ed18393f826a86c36a20bebed39fadee1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758555611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048700/d7b416ed18393f826a86c36a20bebed39fadee1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758555611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butterfly X Demo is consist of 16 levels and all the options of main game are available in it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free Butterfly X game does not have any in-game purghases to progress tjrough the game\u00a0 and\u00a0 featuring  characters from all versions of the Butterfly series of puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can choose any level to pass through. But it will be great if you pass them all, helping the caterpillar to fulfill its mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As usual, the caterpillar can't jump on its own. It can fly from place to place like a butterfly, bouncing off various game objects in its path. It also moves around the level on pipes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you will enjoy it and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Collect all the flowers to advance to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kill bees and bounce off objects to advance to the end of the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use pipes along the way to overcome obstacles in the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Moving objects help to pass the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are several paths, find the right one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Beware of the blue bird, it pecks to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - The levels are very different,\u00a0be alert.</p>","developers":["grin robot"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3468810","name":"Butterfly X"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048700/609ad4c542c9b07ea82460af81b56b9fd2767d4a/header.jpg?t=1758555611","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":